  m_Name: Note_Classroom1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Help
  author: 
  body: 'I don''t know who will find this.


    The doors locked around 2AM and
    the PA system started talking some random nonsense


    Professor Tan was rushing
    down to the control terminal to override it


    I don''t know what happened
    to her after that.


    I hid in here with the other students when the alarms
    blared


    Oh god, they are breaking down the front door


    God protect
    us'
  noteType: 0
